# Repo-wide. Each project also has its own .gitignore for anything specific to it.
.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# macOS Finder metadata. Never useful in a repo, and easy to commit by accident
# from a directory that was opened in Finder.
.DS_Store

# Runtime logs. No exception for checkclaude/bot.log: the copy that was
# committed logged requests_oauthlib at DEBUG, which writes the full signed
# Authorization header — the X app's oauth_consumer_key, the account's
# oauth_token, and session cookies — on every polling request. It has since
# been deleted from the tree, and re-admitting the path lets the next run put
# it straight back. To keep a captured run for the write-up, commit a scrubbed
# excerpt under a different name, or capture at INFO rather than DEBUG.
*.log
.vercel
.env*
